},
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00025",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[14]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 583,
      "endIndex": 584,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00026",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[15]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 584,
      "endIndex": 585,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00027",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[16]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 585,
      "endIndex": 586,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00028",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[17]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 586,
      "endIndex": 601,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1 Introduction",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00029",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[18]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 601,
      "endIndex": 883,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "At Tong Keow’s Hougang outlet, herbs and soup packs sit alongside everyday foods. Staff described purchases for nourishment, throat comfort, fatigue and daily routines. We argue that this retail setting keeps Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) visible and usable in household life.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00030",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[19]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 883,
      "endIndex": 1066,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The report examines food therapy, convenience and local adaptation through displays, staff accounts and public sources, without assessing clinical effectiveness or sales performance.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00031",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[20]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1066,
      "endIndex": 1114,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2 Fieldwork and the neighbourhood medicine hall",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00032",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1114,
      "endIndex": 1149,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2.1 How we conducted the fieldwork",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00033",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[22]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1149,
      "endIndex": 1387,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "We visited Tong Keow on 13 September 2026, photographed displays and interviewed one staff member. Transcripts, the presentation script, and photographs inform this report; we paraphrase unclear meanings where transcripts contain errors.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00034",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[23]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1387,
      "endIndex": 1592,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "We distinguish observations, staff accounts and our interpretations. Published sources provide context, and course concepts guide analysis. Demand descriptions reflect the interviewee’s retail experience.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00035",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[24]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1592,
      "endIndex": 1633,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2.2 Tong Keow and its mixed retail model",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00036",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[25]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1633,
      "endIndex": 1934,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Tong Keow’s profile describes a medicine hall founded in Toa Payoh in 1968 and now run by second-generation family owners. Promotional materials feature American ginseng, monk fruit, cooling teas, pills and plasters (Tong Keow Medical Hall, 2022; “Instagram Reel About Tong Keow Medical Hall,” n.d.).",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00037",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[26]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1934,
      "endIndex": 2166,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The company advertises registered-physician consultations, acupuncture and cupping for indigestion, colds and sprains (“Instagram Reel About Tong Keow Medical Hall,” n.d.). We did not verify these services or observe consultations.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00038",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[27]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2166,
      "endIndex": 2331,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Branded soup packs beside herbs, grains and foods connect the branch to the wider business and allow shoppers to encounter herbal products during grocery purchases.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00039",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[28]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2331,
      "endIndex": 2334,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "[INLINE_OBJECT kix.76qzu6jlbbws][INLINE_OBJECT kix.ug9vxj32widv]",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00040",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[29]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2334,
      "endIndex": 2383,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2.3 Hougang and the customers described by staff",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00041",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[30]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2383,
      "endIndex": 2765,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Staff described mainly Chinese, middle-aged and older customers, including people in their forties and fifties. Hougang had 228,140 planning-area residents in June 2024; HDB reported 57,557 flats and 165,450 residents as of 31 March 2024. These totals cover different populations (Singapore Department of Statistics [DOS], 2024; Housing & Development Board [HDB], 2024, pp. 11–12).",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00042",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[31]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2765,
      "endIndex": 3233,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Hougang Central had about 4,620 residents in June 2025, with roughly 1,070 aged 65 or above (23%) (DOS, 2025). Chua et al.’s (2025) 647 Hougang respondents averaged 69 years of age and 22 years’ residence. The area also has Teochew heritage around Tou Mu Kung, fishing, farming and rubber-growing (National Heritage Board [NHB], n.d.). This established residential setting helps explain the reported clientele, but may not represent outlets in younger neighbourhoods.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00043",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[32]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3233,
      "endIndex": 3236,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "[INLINE_OBJECT kix.8vvmv1f80ppz][INLINE_OBJECT kix.pons4fnu5h03]",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00044",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[33]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3236,
      "endIndex": 3269,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3 Everyday care and food therapy",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00045",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[34]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3269,
      "endIndex": 3298,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3.1 Herbs in household meals",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00046",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[35]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3298,
      "endIndex": 3594,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Staff named Dang Shen (党参), Huang Qi (黄芪), Yu Zhu (玉竹), Huai Shan (淮山), red dates (红枣) and goji (枸杞) as common soup ingredients. Ginseng (人参), American ginseng (西洋参) and monk fruit (罗汉果) were also selected by neighbourhood customers. Table A1 lists these nine staff-described best-selling herbs.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00047",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[36]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "seg